  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace;font-size:14px;color:#000\">一個簡單的模組，為遊戲添加了起司漢堡和切片麵包。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace\">────────────────────</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace\">&nbsp;</span></p><h4><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000\">合成配方：</span></strong></span></h4><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><strong>切片麵包：</strong></span></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/879220770625175613/879395837174775878/BreadCrafting.png\"></span></p>\n</div><p><span style=\"font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace\"><span style=\"color:#000\">起司漢堡：</span></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace;font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/879220770625175613/879395840970600448/BurgerCrafting.png\"></span></p>\n</div><p><span style=\"font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace;font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace;font-size:14px\">黃金起司漢堡：</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace;font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/879220770625175613/879395848260313159/GoldenBurgerCrafting.png\"></span></p>\n</div><p><span style=\"font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace;font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace;font-size:14px\">附魔黃金起司漢堡：</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace;font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/879220770625175613/879395844804202496/EnchGoldenBurgerCrafting.png\"></span></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p>────────────────────</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h4><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace\"><strong>食物屬性：</strong></span></h4><p><span style=\"font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace;font-size:14px\">切片麵包：</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace;font-size:14px\">1 飢餓值 &amp; 0.5 飽食度&nbsp;</span></p>\n</div><p><span style=\"font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace;font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace;font-size:14px\">起司漢堡、黃金起司漢堡和附魔黃金起司漢堡</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-family:'courier new', courier, monospace;font-size:14px\">10 飢餓值 &amp; 10 飽食度</span></p>\n</div>",
